        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Donner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/48/1903_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Donner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can Legacy attack an ally (Motivational Charge), then Heroic Interception vs. the attack, taking no damage because it was his power (heroes can't be hurt by their own powers) then heal himself and his allies 1?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No. Heroic Interception only works during an \"enemy's turn\".</p>",
